<title>PHILIPPINES: Piltel rallies 4.9 percent to 32 pesos.</title>
<headline>Piltel rallies 4.9 percent to 32 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilipino Telephone Corp (Piltel) shares rallied 1.50 pesos, or 4.9 percent, in midsession in Manila Thursday after falling 6.6 percent the previous day, traders said.</p>
